{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the dawn of mankind, mysterious phenomena beyond human comprehension\u00a0 have occurred. Your studies suggest that everything is part of one, big picture. The solution is near; the next expedition will be the crucial one. You turn your gaze to the stars: what lies hidden in the unfathomable depths of the cosmos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/82310814c08fa2de74741bc1af76e1ae.avif?t=1771676530\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras_big/82310814c08fa2de74741bc1af76e1ae.avif?t=1771676530 width=800 height=488 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night falls as the horn's haunting call echoes through the woods. The Great Ceremony is about to begin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/e4019db99bdb350374294c4e0a63c503.avif?t=1771676530\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras_big/e4019db99bdb350374294c4e0a63c503.avif?t=1771676530 width=800 height=492 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Fear is a disturbing Lovecraftian horror experience from the author of The Land of Pain and The Alien Cube.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live your worst nightmares in the darkness of the forests, explore ancient castles and seemingly abandoned villages to uncover the secrets that torment your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/968a247ab0c624445966065844719190.avif?t=1771676530\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras_big/968a247ab0c624445966065844719190.avif?t=1771676530 width=800 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compelling story</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a story filled with mystery and terror, drawn from the darkest corners of Lovecraft's mind.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning visuals</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore highly detailed environments with cutting-edge graphics achieved through the power of photogrammetry and Unreal Engine 5\u2019s latest technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic lights, shadows and volumetric fogs combine to create a visceral horror atmosphere.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sounds</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a meticulously crafted soundtrack and ambient sounds, where even the faintest rustle suggests hidden movement in the dark.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A new chapter in the series</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand the story of The Land of Pain and The Alien Cube as you experience this haunting new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3306920?t=1771676530","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3306920?t=1771676530","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/f01cd78c942831b884eeae54c3a944e99ff151a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771676530","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/f01cd78c942831b884eeae54c3a944e99ff151a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771676530","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"descrip